+Or deploy it to [Wasmer](https://wasmer.io):
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-6B4EFF)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=Nutlope%2FroomGPT)
+
+Wasmer detects Next.js, installs dependencies with npm (from `package-lock.json`), runs `npm run build` (`next build`) and serves the production build with Node. The button builds this public repo as-is and does not fork or copy it; to customize the app (start with `app/dream/page.tsx`) and redeploy on every push, fork it and connect your fork from the Wasmer dashboard. Set these in the app's Settings → Environment Vars:
+
+- `REPLICATE_API_KEY` (required): used by `/generate` to run the ControlNet model on Replicate.
+- `NEXT_PUBLIC_UPLOAD_API_KEY` (optional): your Bytescale key for image uploads; it is inlined at build time, so set it before building. Without it the upload widget uses Bytescale's `free` demo key.
+- `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL` and `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN` (optional): enable rate limiting (5 generations per IP per day); skipped when unset.
+
